{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福州長溪縣永樂鄉欽德佛羅濬捨錢\n菩󴅽名經印施入于大藏仰祝\n今上皇帝　聖壽無彊府縣官僚同資釋息三\n咸證菩提　時紹興二十九年歲次己夘正月　　　謹題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰觀世音　或曰觀自在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰妙吉祥　或輭首童子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰慈氏　或曰阿逸多"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文娟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "代淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "涓帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法護法師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "消安法師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔長者婦生一肉摶問佛言七日當見有百男兒端正無比出家得阿羅漢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年在母胎中既出胎已老故上座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一兄弟二人𡖉所生證果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿育王弟為兄所化後證羅漢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八歲得道遂證阿羅漢果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律經一藏悉皆此尊者所記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生下證果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兄弟雙生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三證果"}
